From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dragos Hont <dragos79@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:12:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] concrt140: Implement _Concurrent_queue_iterator_base_v4

Add the constructor, destructor, _Assign and _Advance of
Concurrency::details::_Concurrent_queue_iterator_base_v4 so programs that
iterate a concurrent_queue no longer hit a missing export. Observed as a
fatal error on a game loading screen (Forza Horizon 6 research).
